00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:26.000
Stephanie did what she'd been trained to do. What most of us would do in a moment like that. Do whatever it takes to try and save a life. Get to tomorrow. She moved slowly to get him out so that he could breathe, and then she sat there and held him until the ambulance arrived.

