I kept saying, oh, Steph, really, think about the odds. Come on. Let's just see. And I did my rational thing that I had always done with her. I laid it out, what the odds were. I'm doing it for myself as well. And but that had told me it was on her mind. They knew they'd have to keep searching for answers,

