and started calling family. Stephanie was eventually diagnosed with a type of ALS that affects swallowing and speech first. She was told she most likely had somewhere between two and five years to live. So in typical Stephanie fashion, she got on with the living right away. She made a cross-country road trip with her two older sons, Jason and Matthew. She took a cruise to the Caribbean with a friend. And then when she came back, she got in the van and took two of her sons down to Florida.

