And whenever they could, John and Stephanie went to a beach right near their home. A beautiful beach, Fort Fisher. You could walk it for miles. And that she loved. She just, that was her church. This year, you can walk it for miles. And that she loved. That was her church. John had to make some changes as well. He retired from his job and got a long overdue hip replacement. He wanted to be healthy and strong for his wife

