00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:42.000
So that was a little bit of a surprise to me. But again, I was hanging my hat on. She knows what she's going to do. It was one thing to talk about end of life issues when they were hypothetical. All those years of conversations they'd had were earnest and serious, but they were intellectual. Now, death was in the room with them.

